  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Cook rice: Fill a medium saucepan three-quarters full with water and bring to the boil. Add the rice and cook for 25-27 mins until tender. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2590312/photos/large/158150_1-35d44ff365e0c4ea5de3887100e4fa91.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pickle carrot: Meanwhile, peel the carrot into ribbons with a vegetable peeler. Combine 3 tsp white vinegar, 1½ tsp sugar and ¼ tsp salt in a large bowl. Add the carrot and toss to combine. Set aside to pickle, tossing occasionally, until needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2590313/photos/large/158150_2-947f5579e5085210df439206169736fb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir-fry tofu: Slice the tofu. Heat 2 tsp vegetable oil in a large frypan over medium-high heat. Stir-fry the tofu for 2 mins or until browned.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2590314/photos/large/158150_3-be9455b050143c8f1cc73c9c1445c983.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add sauce and spinach: Add the stir-fry sauce to the tofu and stir-fry for a further 1-2 mins until warmed through. Add the spinach and toss until slightly wilted. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2590315/photos/large/158150_4-69459f7d2181e6dcc622e3324714fee4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Coarsely chop the peanuts. Divide the rice, tofu stir-fry and drained pickled carrot among bowls. Scatter over the peanuts and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2590316/photos/large/158150_5-0eab5f903f923f9a3f28fdf7261a3af1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen notes: Add a kick with a pinch of chilli flakes, or boost the freshness with a scattering of thinly sliced spring onion, if you have some on hand.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2590317/photos/large/158150_6-77c9a43b1ada44ad612b12e70dd13012.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
